        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant T as Bộ hẹn giờ\n    participant C as NhacLichControl&lt;br/&gt;«control»\n    participant TS as ThamSoHeThong&lt;br/&gt;«entity»\n    participant LT as LichTiem&lt;br/&gt;«entity»\n    participant NL as NhacLich&lt;br/&gt;«entity»\n    participant S as INhacLichSender&lt;br/&gt;(Email/SMS)\n\n    T-&gt;&gt;C: chạy định kỳ hằng ngày\n    C-&gt;&gt;TS: lay(\&quot;SoNgayNhacTruoc\&quot;)\n    C-&gt;&gt;LT: timLichChoTiemTrongKhoang(ngayHienTai, soNgay)\n    LT--&gt;&gt;C: danh sách lịch tới hạn\n    loop mỗi lịch chưa có nhắc\n        C-&gt;&gt;NL: taoMoi(lichId, kenh, ChoGui)\n    end\n    C-&gt;&gt;NL: layChoGui()\n    loop mỗi nhắc ChoGui\n        C-&gt;&gt;S: gui(nhac)\n        alt gửi thành công\n            S--&gt;&gt;C: ok\n            C-&gt;&gt;NL: danhDauDaGui()\n        else lỗi\n            S--&gt;&gt;C: lỗi\n            C-&gt;&gt;NL: danhDauLoi()\n        end\n    end\n```\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="KS2FB-KETUeM0ystBkgZ-585">
